# Title: Suspicious Process Start Locations
# ID: 15b75071-74cc-47e0-b4c6-b43744a62a2b
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: juju4, Jonhnathan Ribeiro, oscd.community
# Date: 2019-01-16
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036, car.2013-05-002
# Description: Detects suspicious process run from unusual locations
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_path="*:\\RECYCLER\\*" OR process_path="*:\\SystemVolumeInformation\\*")) OR ((process_path="C:\\Windows\\Tasks\\*" OR process_path="C:\\Windows\\debug\\*" OR process_path="C:\\Windows\\fonts\\*" OR process_path="C:\\Windows\\help\\*" OR process_path="C:\\Windows\\drivers\\*" OR process_path="C:\\Windows\\addins\\*" OR process_path="C:\\Windows\\cursors\\*" OR process_path="C:\\Windows\\system32\\tasks\\*")))
